 us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1666499665475967", "version": "1.0.9b"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1666499665475967"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.9 Rank Cosmetics\n\ud83c\udf81 Rank Cosmetics\n\nReach Level 5, 10, 15, and 20 to unlock exclusive Kabuto Hats!\nOpen the Hat tab in your Skin Inventory after leveling up to claim your reward.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Weekly Challenge: Sole Survivor\n\nBe the last Ninja standing!\n\nChallenge\n\n*  Win 20 Survivor Mode matches (Finish 1st) \n\nSpecial Reward\n\n* Crimson Apex Needle\n* Only available through this week's Weekly Challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade Collection\n\nApex Needle\n\nA sleek, razor-sharp blade collection crafted for elite ninjas.\nAvailable in the Shop:\n\n*  Azure Apex Needle \n*  Emerald Apex Needle \n\n\n\u231a Watch Update\n\nYour Watch just got smarter!\n\n*  Vote for the next map directly from your Watch. \n*  Track Quest progress and Level Up rewards without leaving the game. \n\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 MVP Photo Zone\n\nCelebrate your victory in style!\n\n* The match MVP is now featured on the Match Live screen!\n* Visit the \"Strike Your MVP Pose\" booth and record your own victory pose for everyone to see.\n\n\nQuest & Weekly Challenge Refresh\n\n* The Quest Machines have been redesigned into Quest Boards to make everything easier to read.\n* Check today's Daily Quests and Weekly Challenge above the Inventory Machines.\n\n\nImprovements\n\nMatch Time Limit\n\n* Every game mode now has a 3-minute time limit.\n* No more endless Team Mode matches!\n\n\nBlade Collision Fix\n\n* Fixed an issue where the ball could occasionally pass through your blade during close-range rallies.\n* Parries should now feel much more reliable.\n\n\nPrivate Room Matchmaking Fix\n\n*  Fixed an issue where players could occasionally join private rooms through public matchmaking.", "created_date": 1784842971, "id": "1666499665475967", "version": "1.0.9b", "version_code": 94, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1666499665475967"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.9 Rank Cosmetics\n\ud83c\udf81 Rank Cosmetics\n\nReach Level 5, 10, 15, and 20 to unlock exclusive Kabuto Hats!\nOpen the Hat tab in your Skin Inventory after leveling up to claim your reward.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Weekly Challenge: Sole Survivor\n\nBe the last Ninja standing!\n\nChallenge\n\n*  Win 20 Survivor Mode matches (Finish 1st) \n\nSpecial Reward\n\n* Crimson Apex Needle\n* Only available through this week's Weekly Challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade Collection\n\nApex Needle\n\nA sleek, razor-sharp blade collection crafted for elite ninjas.\nAvailable in the Shop:\n\n*  Azure Apex Needle \n*  Emerald Apex Needle \n\n\n\u231a Watch Update\n\nYour Watch just got smarter!\n\n*  Vote for the next map directly from your Watch. \n*  Track Quest progress and Level Up rewards without leaving the game. \n\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 MVP Photo Zone\n\nCelebrate your victory in style!\n\n* The match MVP is now featured on the Match Live screen!\n* Visit the \"Strike Your MVP Pose\" booth and record your own victory pose for everyone to see.\n\n\nQuest & Weekly Challenge Refresh\n\n* The Quest Machines have been redesigned into Quest Boards to make everything easier to read.\n* Check today's Daily Quests and Weekly Challenge above the Inventory Machines.\n\n\nImprovements\n\nMatch Time Limit\n\n* Every game mode now has a 3-minute time limit.\n* No more endless Team Mode matches!\n\n\nBlade Collision Fix\n\n* Fixed an issue where the ball could occasionally pass through your blade during close-range rallies.\n* Parries should now feel much more reliable.\n\n\nPrivate Room Matchmaking Fix\n\n*  Fixed an issue where players could occasionally join private rooms through public matchmaking.\n", "created_date": 1784783030, "id": "1665793188879948", "version": "1.0.9a", "version_code": 93, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1666499665475967"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.9 Rank Cosmetics\n\ud83c\udf81 Rank Cosmetics\n\nReach Level 5, 10, 15, and 20 to unlock exclusive Kabuto Hats!\nOpen the Hat tab in your Skin Inventory after leveling up to claim your reward.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Weekly Challenge: Sole Survivor\n\nBe the last Ninja standing!\n\nChallenge\n\n*  Win 20 Survivor Mode matches (Finish 1st) \n\nSpecial Reward\n\n* Crimson Apex Needle\n* Only available through this week's Weekly Challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade Collection\n\nApex Needle\n\nA sleek, razor-sharp blade collection crafted for elite ninjas.\nAvailable in the Shop:\n\n*  Azure Apex Needle \n*  Emerald Apex Needle \n\n\n\u231a Watch Update\n\nYour Watch just got smarter!\n\n*  Vote for the next map directly from your Watch. \n*  Track Quest progress and Level Up rewards without leaving the game. \n\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 MVP Photo Zone\n\nCelebrate your victory in style!\n\n* The match MVP is now featured on the Match Live screen!\n* Visit the \"Strike Your MVP Pose\" booth and record your own victory pose for everyone to see.\n\n\nQuest & Weekly Challenge Refresh\n\n* The Quest Machines have been redesigned into Quest Boards to make everything easier to read.\n* Check today's Daily Quests and Weekly Challenge above the Inventory Machines.\n\n\nImprovements\n\nMatch Time Limit\n\n* Every game mode now has a 3-minute time limit.\n* No more endless Team Mode matches!\n\n\nBlade Collision Fix\n\n* Fixed an issue where the ball could occasionally pass through your blade during close-range rallies.\n* Parries should now feel much more reliable.\n\n", "created_date": 1784775345, "id": "1665721922220408", "version": "1.0.9", "version_code": 92, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1666499665475967"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1784773886, "id": "1665708605555073", "version": "1.0.9", "version_code": 91, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1666499665475967"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_r